# Portage metadata cache: generated locally by egencache / pmaint regen.
# Not committed — entries embed gentoo eclass checksums, so a committed copy
# goes stale whenever the gentoo tree updates an eclass, with no commit here.
# Portage computes and caches metadata in /var/cache/edb/dep when it is absent
# (no FEATURES=metadata-transfer required).
metadata/md5-cache/
